%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
## Support of Molecule framework
We added the missing representation of `Molecule` symbol

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Molecule["NC(=O)C[C@H](C(=O)O)N"]

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Molecule[(*VB[*) {"N", "C", "O", "C", Atom["C", "HydrogenCount" -> 1], "C", "O", "O", "N"}, {Bond[{1, 2}, "Single"], Bond[{2, 3}, "Double"], Bond[{2, 4}, "Single"], Bond[{4, 5}, "Single"], Bond[{5, 6}, "Single"], Bond[{6, 7}, "Double"], Bond[{6, 8}, "Single"], Bond[{5, 9}, "Single"]}, {StereochemistryElements -> {<|"StereoType" -> "Tetrahedral", "ChiralCenter" -> 5, "Direction" -> "Counterclockwise"|>}} (*,*)(*"1:"*)(*]VB*)]

